-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What this license covers
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers the original work in this repository: the mod's
code (main.lua, options.lua, src/), the build tools (tools/), the tests
(tests/), the hand-written documentation, and these item sprites by Wooble,
which are part of assets/items/icons.png:

  Auspicious Armor, Malicious Armor, Metal Alloy, Peat Block, Syrupy Apple,
  Unremarkable Teacup, Masterpiece Teacup

and the Fairy type icons in assets/types/ (drawn for this mod).

It does NOT cover the following, which belong to their own authors and are
used here with credit (see CREDITS.md). They are not licensed to you by this
file:

  - The cries in assets/cries/ (fan-made, by the authors in CREDITS.md).
  - The battle animations in data/anims.lua, borrowed from RHH's
    pokeemerald-expansion (Rom Hacking Hideout and its contributors; see
    CREDITS.md).
  - Every other item sprite in assets/items/icons.png (fan-made, by the
    authors in CREDITS.md).
  - The Pokedex summaries in data/species/ (the games' own text, taken from
    PokeAPI), and the names, statistics and other facts about Pokemon and
    items in data/ and docs/, which come from PokeAPI and the games.
  - Pokemon and all related names, characters and marks, which are the
    property of Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc. This is an
    unofficial fan project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
